<programme start="20261025080100 +0000" stop="20261025085300 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Terror</title><sub-title lang="en">Infamy: A Sparrow in a Swallow&apos;s Nest</sub-title><desc lang="en">In 1941, Chester Nakayama is caught between his insular Japanese-American neighborhood on Terminal Island and his current all-American life; extreme circumstances push his community and personal life to the brink, all while someone watches closely.</desc><credits><actor>Derek Mio</actor><actor>Shingo Usami</actor><actor>Naoko Mori</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15107294_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
