<programme start="20261024150000 +0000" stop="20261024160000 +0000" channel="BBC America - East"><title lang="en">Planet Earth: Blue Planet II</title><sub-title lang="en">Coasts</sub-title><desc lang="en">At the coast, two worlds collide. Coasts is the story of how our wildlife survives in this ever-changing world. It&apos;s a roller-coaster ride of heart-stopping action and epic drama, with characters from beautiful to bizarre.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p14568089_b_v8_ah.jpg"/></programme>
